OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 27 NOV
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham with live music in
OL,6,     Gthe studio from young Latvian
OL,7,     Gaccordionist Alise Silina.
OL,8,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,9,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,10,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,11,     Gincluding a motet by Bruckner and
OL,12,     GVenus from Holst's The Planets.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GThe RLPO and Alpesh Chauhan
OL,15,     Gpresent a concert inspired by the
OL,16,     Gspirit of dance from the
OL,17,     Gorchestra's home in Liverpool
OL,18,     Gincluding music by Copland,
OL,19,     GBritten, Simon and Ravel.
