OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 27 NOV
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GThis week, Soweto's guest for has
OL,6,     Gbeen trombonist and producer
OL,7,     GRosie Turton. To conclude her
OL,8,     Gweek, Rosie picks a much-loved
OL,9,     Grecord by a seminal British
OL,10,     Gexperimental jazz band.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GCornelius Meister conducts the
OL,13,     GGerman Symphony Orchestra, Berlin
OL,14,     Gin Mahler's 4th Symphony with
OL,15,     Gsoprano Hanna-Elisabeth Muller.
OL,16,     GPlus music from Unsuk Chin's
OL,17,     G"Alice in Wonderland".
